## Why This Is Asked

This tests the ability to design a reproducible, tamper-evident debugging workflow for production cca_score pipelines, where nondeterminism and privacy concerns complicate replay.

## Key Concepts

- Deterministic replay using fixed seeds
- Tamper-evident logging and signed manifests
- Input hashing and per-tenant keys
- Nonces to prevent replay reuse

